> +			} else {
> +				emit(ctx, divu, dst, src);
> +				emit(ctx, mfhi, dst);
> +			}
>   		}
>   		break;
>   	}
Your patch would be clearer if you extract a pair of emit_div()
and emit_mod() helpers in a preliminary patch, then include the
32r6 support (this patch).

My 2 cents anyway.

Regards,

Phil.

